# "SLIDE" — Trap / 808
# BeatForge Studio

bpm 140
swing 10
steps 32
kit 808

# Master
reverb 0.15
delay 0.10
enhancer 0.35
width 1.10

# Drums
kick     "x.....x.....x.x.x.....x.....x.x."
snare    "....x.......x.......x.......x..."
hh       "xoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxx"
oh       "..............x...............x."
clap     "....x.......x.......x.......x..."

# Drum mix
vol kick 0.90
vol snare 0.75
vol hh 0.40
vol clap 0.65
vol oh 0.35
pan hh 0.15
lpf hh 7000
dist kick 0.15
sidechain kick hh
sidechain kick oh

# 808 Bass
scale C minor
note "C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ Eb1 ~ ~ ~ G1 ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ Eb1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"

# Dark lead
note "C4 ~ Eb4 ~ F4 ~ Eb4 ~ C4 ~ ~ ~ Bb3 ~ ~ ~ C4 ~ Eb4 ~ G4 ~ Eb4 ~ C4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"
